-- Regulation 6(2): rounding does not apply to the daily rate of regulation 111.
-- src:178 | (2) This regulation does not apply to the calculation in regulation 111 (daily rate for a reduction under section 26 or 27 of the Act).
@ref reg 6(2) (src:178)
GIVEN `the calculation is the daily rate for a reduction under section 26 or 27 of the Act in regulation 111` IS A BOOLEAN  -- out of range: regulation 111 (piece uc4)
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`reg 6(2) — regulation 6 applies to the calculation` `the calculation is the daily rate for a reduction under section 26 or 27 of the Act in regulation 111` MEANS
    NOT `the calculation is the daily rate for a reduction under section 26 or 27 of the Act in regulation 111`
